# Note: beeui.config.json, src/components/beeui/, src/lib/beeui/, and
# src/beeui/theme.css are produced by `beeui add` (see setup.sh) but are
# intentionally NOT ignored — source ownership means the consumer commits
# and owns these files, exactly like a real BeeUI source-ownership consumer
# would. setup.sh reproduces them deterministically (`beeui add` is
# idempotent: identical content reports UNCHANGED, see docs/registry-cli.md).
